WEBVTT

00:33.352 --> 00:41.619
The water runs, the towel is warm, washing off

00:42.960 --> 00:48.385
the lingering storm. The heavy scent of diesel

00:48.425 --> 00:53.930
fumes replaced by soap in quiet rooms.

00:59.540 --> 01:07.346
Lift your arms, a gentle sound My feet are

01:08.768 --> 01:14.872
hovering off the ground The wet and cold are

01:14.973 --> 01:20.297
peeled away To face the light of this new day In

01:20.317 --> 01:26.262
the airside sanctuary

01:29.137 --> 01:35.359
The world is soft and light No more shadows, no

01:35.379 --> 01:41.021
more scary Fragments of the night

01:45.162 --> 01:48.823
I'm clean, I'm dry, I'm safe, I'm here Watching

01:48.843 --> 01:57.706
the grey clouds disappear inside Safe inside

02:02.901 --> 02:10.544
The door is locked, but I'm not trapped The map of

02:10.664 --> 02:20.287
hell has been remapped You turn to me, you meet my

02:20.847 --> 02:27.490
eyes No anger there, no heavy sighs

02:31.446 --> 02:40.176
You softly ask, removing one more heavy mask.

02:42.038 --> 02:47.504
You give me space, you give me choice, you give me

02:47.645 --> 02:49.867
back my stolen voice.

02:58.374 --> 03:02.238
In the airside sanctuary

03:05.021 --> 03:11.208
The world is soft and light No more shadows, no

03:11.248 --> 03:15.353
more scary Fragments of the night

03:21.033 --> 03:24.734
I'm clean, I'm dry, I'm safe, I'm here watching

03:24.834 --> 03:35.878
the grey clouds disappear inside Safe inside

03:46.962 --> 03:54.316
Ticket in my pocket Gateway on the wing Boarding

03:54.396 --> 04:01.863
Group A The finest thing A miracle of time and

04:01.943 --> 04:07.028
chance A victory in a single glance The busiest

04:07.389 --> 04:13.494
day of all the year But somehow

04:16.988 --> 04:22.151
We are sitting here.

04:23.771 --> 04:32.055
Turn my chair to face the glass. Watch the heavy

04:33.336 --> 04:40.719
shadows pass. The engines roar. The birds take

04:40.939 --> 04:47.419
flight. Into the morning light

04:49.761 --> 04:51.963
Just hold me

04:56.166 --> 04:58.068
Just hold me

